WEBVTT

00:03.432 --> 00:08.780
Hey, sorry about the noise back there. Let's

00:08.800 --> 00:13.367
bring the temple back down. We've got you.

00:18.765 --> 00:22.166
The weekend's here, we're putting on the shoes

00:22.446 --> 00:25.367
We're laughing in the mirror, shaking off the

00:25.427 --> 00:28.949
blues There's makeup on the counter, jackets on

00:28.989 --> 00:32.330
the bed And you are right here with us, absorbing

00:32.390 --> 00:35.611
what is said No need to change the subject, no

00:35.651 --> 00:38.332
need to clear the room You're part of every

00:38.392 --> 00:41.293
secret that echoes in the gloom

00:45.110 --> 00:49.014
No fragile egos standing in the way No heavy

00:49.114 --> 00:53.118
expectations ruining the day You are the safest

00:53.158 --> 00:56.841
harbor that we have ever known And you will never

00:56.901 --> 01:02.827
have to face the outside world alone Because you

01:03.147 --> 01:08.392
are one of the girls Yeah, you are riding with the

01:08.572 --> 01:13.884
flock We are skipping all the groomsmen We are

01:14.084 --> 01:19.366
running down the clock From the living room to

01:19.406 --> 01:24.907
the city lights You are always on the list You're

01:24.927 --> 01:29.729
the center of the circle You're the one that

01:29.909 --> 01:34.210
can't be missed Shoulder to shoulder As the

01:34.270 --> 01:36.731
chaotic world spins

01:39.350 --> 01:42.673
You are one of the girls, and that is where the

01:42.733 --> 01:44.075
story begins.

01:46.670 --> 01:49.131
When the outside gets exhausting and the

01:49.191 --> 01:52.613
gentlemen are loud We bring you in the center and

01:52.653 --> 01:55.975
we separate the crowd You never have to prove a

01:56.055 --> 01:59.176
thing, you never have to fight Just roll into the

01:59.256 --> 02:02.918
circle and share the Friday night A man of honor

02:02.978 --> 02:05.600
sitting right exactly where he should The

02:05.660 --> 02:09.462
purest kind of loyalty completely understood

02:13.263 --> 02:17.084
No fragile egos standing in the way No heavy

02:17.204 --> 02:21.185
expectations ruining the day You are the safest

02:21.205 --> 02:24.866
harbor that we have ever known And you will never

02:24.926 --> 02:30.788
have to face the outside world alone Because you

02:31.108 --> 02:36.450
are one of the girls Yeah, you are riding with the

02:36.590 --> 02:42.113
flock We are skipping all the groomsmen. We are

02:42.133 --> 02:47.357
running down the clock. From the living room to

02:47.377 --> 02:51.761
the city lights, you are always on the list.

02:52.602 --> 02:57.146
You're the center of the circles. You're the one

02:57.166 --> 03:01.990
that can't be missed. Shoulder to shoulder as

03:02.050 --> 03:04.713
the chaotic world spins.

03:07.226 --> 03:10.568
You are one of the girls, and that is where the

03:10.628 --> 03:12.069
story begins.

03:15.711 --> 03:20.514
No filters, no walls, just absolute trust. When

03:20.534 --> 03:23.897
the evening calls, we're dropping the armor,

03:23.937 --> 03:27.079
we're feeling the grace. You're a permanent

03:27.139 --> 03:33.975
fixture in our safe space. Because you are one of

03:33.995 --> 03:40.359
the girls Yeah, you are riding with the flock We

03:40.419 --> 03:45.141
are skipping all the groomsmen We are running

03:45.181 --> 03:50.524
